  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chicken parmesan in the air fryer skips the hot oil but keeps the panko crust crisp. The trick is to flatten the chicken breast to an even thickness before breading: this gives even cooking and prevents the edges from drying out while the thick centre catches up. Pound to about 1.5 cm at the thickest point."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
